                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just wow! As someone who played the bejeesus out of Lemmings as a kid, this is absolutely what I was looking for in a VR game.\nThe music is fantastic as well as the environments, and the gnomelings are so damn cute I can't stand it!\nGreat difficulty curve, and most puzzles will take you multiple attempts to beat.  My kids love it and so do I!\n\nIf I have to find something to complain about, the 2D elements like UI and font choices are a little bit lacking and not quite as amazing as all of the 3D stuff, but hey it's Early Access!  Also, sometimes you try to grab a Gnome and you end up grabbing the world instead.\n\nI've been a fan of Dano's work since Gnomes vs. Fairies and I'm really looking forward to seeing what he's going to add in the coming months!   Good job.",
